{title: Praise, My Soul, the King of Heaven}
{key: C}
{time: 4/4}

{start_of_verse: 1}
[C]Praise, my [G]soul, the [C]King of [F]heav[C]en, [F]to the [C]throne thy [Dm]tribute [G]bring
[E7]Ransomed, [**]healed, re[A]stored, for[D]given, [Em]ever[Am]more God's [D]praises [G]sing
[C]Alle[F]luia! [Am]Alle[G]luia! [Am]Praise the [Dm]ever[G]lasting [C]King.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 2}
[C]Praise the [G]Lord for [C]grace and [F]fa[C]vor [F]to all [C]people [Dm]in dis[G]tress
[E7]Praise God, [**]still the [A]same as [D]ever, [Em]slow to [Am]chide, and [D]swift to [G]bless
[C]Alle[F]luia! [Am]Alle[G]luia! [Am]Glorious [Dm]now God's [G]faithful[C]ness.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 3}
[C]Father[G]like, God [C]tends and [F]spares [C]us; [F]well our [C]feeble [Dm]frame God [G]knows
[E7]Mother[**]like, God [A]gently [D]bears us, [Em]rescues [Am]us from [D]all our [G]foes
[C]Alle[F]luia! [Am]Alle[G]luia! [Am]Widely [Dm]yet God's [G]mercy [C]flows.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 4}
[C]Angels [G]in the [C]heights, a[F]do[C]ring, [F]you be[C]hold God [Dm]face to [G]face
[E7]Saints triumphant[**], [A]now a[D]doring, [Em]gathered [Am]in from [D]every [G]race
[C]Alle[F]luia! [Am]Alle[G]luia! [Am]Praise with [Dm]us the [G]God of [C]grace.
{end_of_verse}
